&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://pho3nix-jacki3.github.io/p/lab-portswigger-web-security-academy-web-shell-upload-via-extension-blacklist-bypass/img/aid389ajdadHADUAHD3.jpg&#34;
